Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.02,0:02:53.40,OP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}{\1c&H827B25&}J{\1c&H778D3B&}u{\1c&H6D9F50&}s{\1c&H63AF64&}t{\1c&H5BBD75&} {\1c&H53CC87&}w{\1c&H45E4A4&}a{\1c&H59DCB0&}n{\1c&H74CEB9&}n{\1c&H8FBFC2&}a{\1c&HA9B1CA&} {\1c&HC5A1D3&}m{\1c&HE98EDF&}a{\1c&HEE95CF&}k{\1c&HEF9FBC&}e{\1c&HF0A8AB&} {\1c&HF1B199&}y{\1c&HF3BC84&}o{\1c&HF4C771&}u{\1c&HEAC26C&} {\1c&HCAA57A&}h{\1c&HA88689&}a{\1c&H876897&}p{\1c&H6549A6&}p{\1c&H442BB4&}y{\1c&H3019BE&}!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.88,0:20:44.01,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}A sunny early Sunday afternoon
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.01,0:20:47.06,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Let's go somewhere today
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.35,0:20:53.93,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}It's the same road I'm used to traveling
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.93,0:20:58.44,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}But I can see it sparkling so bright
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.61,0:21:03.95,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}With the sun shining down its warmth
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.91,0:21:08.66,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}And you here by my side...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.66,0:21:13.49,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}I'm already high, high, high {Oh i'm sure of that}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.49,0:21:18.87,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}I feel like dashing out
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.25,0:21:23.72,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Sing, la, la, la
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.09,0:21:29.20,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}My voice out to forever
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.72,0:21:34.14,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}I'm already high, high, high
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.39,0:21:39.59,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Ride the dancing wind
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.19,0:21:44.66,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Sing, la, la, la
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.95,0:21:49.87,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}My voice springs up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.48,0:00:09.07,Default,Newscaster,0000,0000,0000,,Typhoon #13 is maintaining its gale force winds
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.07,0:00:09.94,Default,Newscaster,0000,0000,0000,,as it continues to make its way north.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.40,0:00:14.91,Default,Newscaster,0000,0000,0000,,The storm struck South Daitou Island last night at roughly 11 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.34,0:00:18.33,Default,Newscaster,0000,0000,0000,,As of now, the effect on transportation in all areas...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.66,0:00:22.33,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.87,0:00:26.00,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,The TV says the bullet train is pooping!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:33.51,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Not pooping! Operating!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.51,0:00:34.88,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Pooping?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.88,0:00:36.30,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Operating!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.30,0:00:41.13,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,They probably said, "The bullet train is operating on normal schedules."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.13,0:00:43.35,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That means it's running like as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.77,0:00:48.18,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,The bullet train is pooping!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.74,0:00:57.11,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-oh. I gotta poop!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.49,0:01:00.91,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.16,0:01:06.71,Default,Newscaster,0000,0000,0000,,Typhoon #13 has changed its course and is gradually moving east,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.71,0:01:10.75,Default,Newscaster,0000,0000,0000,,where it's expected to make landfall in the Tokai area this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.92,0:01:13.38,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,She said there's a typhoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.80,0:01:16.93,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's all right. Typhoons come every year...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.93,0:01:18.34,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.30,0:01:21.89,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Outta toilet paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.89,0:01:23.47,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,You should see how much I'm making!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.47,0:01:25.14,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Bring a ruler!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.50,0:01:28.44,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Boys are notoriously childish, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.44,0:01:30.90,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I feel your pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.92,0:03:14.54,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll pick you up early today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.54,0:03:15.38,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.42,0:03:17.92,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.97,0:03:21.63,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Awesome, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.63,0:03:23.05,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We're gonna be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.18,0:03:25.51,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,See ya later!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.77,0:03:42.95,Default,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,If you leave just enough space for the circles, then you'll write it like a pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.95,0:03:43.66,Default,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.66,0:03:46.78,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Teacher, how much is "just enough"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.78,0:03:48.04,Default,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.04,0:03:49.87,Default,Boy A,0000,0000,0000,,How many centimeters? Millimeters?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.59,0:04:01.51,Default,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,How about we forget the circles?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.51,0:04:03.22,Default,Class,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.43,0:04:07.39,Default,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,All right, the rest will be your homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.39,0:04:11.31,Default,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,For the next activity, all the first-graders are going to draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.64,0:04:14.27,Default,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,Meet up outside in front of your own morning glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.27,0:04:15.56,Default,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.56,0:04:17.23,Default,Class,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.28,0:04:31.12,Default,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,Why are sandbags so heavy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.12,0:04:33.71,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's still morning and I'm already beat...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.71,0:04:36.46,Default,Beanpole,0000,0000,0000,,And it had to be today that we've got tons to ship...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.00,0:04:41.21,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.05,0:04:44.17,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.26,0:04:47.89,Default,Beanpole,0000,0000,0000,,My kids' educational insurance...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.93,0:04:51.18,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,They're still in diapers!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.18,0:04:54.35,Default,Beanpole,0000,0000,0000,,If I waited 'til they got bigger, the insurance wouldn't mean a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.35,0:04:56.77,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,G-Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.77,0:04:59.11,Default,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,We're enrolled too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.11,0:05:02.32,Default,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,Although I kinda doubt he'll be college material with my genes...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.69,0:05:05.70,Default,Beanpole,0000,0000,0000,,We've got two, so it'll be pretty tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.70,0:05:07.70,Default,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,Ours is still a little squirt, so we got day-care fees too,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.70,0:05:09.70,Default,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,which is nothin' to sneeze at.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.70,0:05:11.54,Default,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,And he outgrows clothes faster than we can buy 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.83,0:05:14.66,Default,Beanpole,0000,0000,0000,,Well, we're only contract employees, but it helps
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.66,0:05:19.00,Default,Beanpole,0000,0000,0000,,that welfare and health insurance are included.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.33,0:05:21.80,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What about life insurance?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.80,0:05:23.80,Default,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,My wife took care of that for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.80,0:05:26.47,Default,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,The payout's pretty decent if I kick the bucket,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.47,0:05:28.26,Default,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,but she has universal life insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.26,0:05:29.97,Default,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,The basic one...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.97,0:05:33.97,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You guys really are "fathers", aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.97,0:05:35.48,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.48,0:05:37.94,Default,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothin' to be impressed about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.52,0:05:41.77,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder how much insurance costs...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.23,0:05:45.57,Default,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,The brat next door is too damn noisy so we wanna move,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.57,0:05:47.05,Default,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,but the money just ain't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.05,0:05:51.16,Default,Beanpole,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I don't even know what I'm workin' for...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.91,0:05:53.45,Default,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,Take a good look at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.45,0:05:55.29,Default,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,Get married, and this is what happens!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.33,0:05:58.75,Default,Mayunashi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have a girlfriend, so there's no danger of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.17,0:06:01.96,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,They're always bitchin' and moanin', yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.00,0:06:06.80,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Deep down, there's a sense of security...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.26,0:06:12.43,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I can't imagine them ever becoming like Rin's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.12,0:06:33.95,Default,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.53,0:06:36.66,Default,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Sit down and draw!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.22,0:06:45.84,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.84,0:06:52.05,Default,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Where's your drawing board?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.47,0:06:55.76,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Dunno. The ground's flat, so I don't need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.36,0:06:58.02,Default,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,That's not gonna work!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.02,0:07:00.48,Default,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,If I tell you to bring something, you bring it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.92,0:07:02.85,Default,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Get it right now! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.36,0:07:10.61,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, your drawing is really good, Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.61,0:07:12.24,Default,Girl A,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it is! It's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.24,0:07:13.57,Default,Girl A,0000,0000,0000,,So pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.57,0:07:15.20,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Really..?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.20,0:07:17.04,Default,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,That's really good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.54,0:07:22.83,Default,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,The colors of these two flowers are slightly different.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.13,0:07:27.59,Default,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's drawing shows that with both bluish and purplish colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.76,0:07:31.05,Default,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,You have a sharp eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.85,0:07:40.73,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki and those boys are wandering around again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.15,0:07:47.90,Default,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.36,0:07:50.49,Default,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,It's drawing time right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.65,0:07:55.07,Default,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, your morning glories are looking splendid!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.66,0:07:58.70,Default,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,It would be a waste not to sketch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.70,0:08:01.00,Default,Tatsumi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you like to draw, Kouki?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.12,0:08:03.67,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay, I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.17,0:08:05.96,Default,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Tatsumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.27,0:08:09.09,Default,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,I'm in charge of this boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.09,0:08:12.97,Default,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you always, always bother everyone, Kouki?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.97,0:08:15.01,Default,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Sit down and draw!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.01,0:08:16.51,Default,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,And don't make any weird faces!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.86,0:08:32.86,Default,Boy B,0000,0000,0000,,I got Kouki's hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.86,0:08:34.03,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.74,0:08:38.95,Default,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Kouki! Boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.95,0:08:40.16,Default,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Stop fooling around!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.16,0:08:41.08,Default,Female Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.54,0:08:43.54,Default,Boy B,0000,0000,0000,,I got it! I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.29,0:08:49.38,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.84,0:08:54.93,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.93,0:08:57.22,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sit down and draw!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.22,0:08:58.43,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Don't let them get you in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.23,0:09:06.44,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,'Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.20,0:09:20.45,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,That was incredible, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.45,0:09:25.37,Default,Girl A,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki's always so weird, and he's scary when he gets mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.98,0:09:28.29,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,He'll bully you, Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.29,0:09:32.84,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No, he won't! I've known him since kindergarten!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.42,0:09:35.05,Default,Girl A,0000,0000,0000,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.48,0:09:53.07,Default,Beanpole,0000,0000,0000,,They're late...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.66,0:10:02.20,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You guys pick your kids up at 6 too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.20,0:10:04.50,Default,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Cuttin' it close today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.15,0:10:06.79,Default,Mayunashi,0000,0000,0000,,Here they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.79,0:10:12.75,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,All right! Let's get it over with!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.75,0:10:13.84,Default,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.68,0:10:23.22,Default,Instructors 1 and 2,0000,0000,0000,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.65,0:10:25.89,Default,Instructor 2,0000,0000,0000,,You got a little wet, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.89,0:10:29.10,Default,Instructor 1,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! Your father's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.69,0:10:30.98,Default,Instructor 2,0000,0000,0000,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.65,0:10:33.61,Default,Instructor 1,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.61,0:10:35.65,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all. Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.11,0:10:38.28,Default,Instructor 1,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go get Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.28,0:10:41.36,Default,Instructor 2,0000,0000,0000,,The wind's really picked up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.36,0:10:45.12,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. I tried to get here earlier, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.12,0:10:46.75,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Am I the last?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.75,0:10:48.71,Default,Instructor 2,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki's still here...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.71,0:10:50.29,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.96,0:10:52.29,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,There's a storm, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.29,0:10:54.59,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. It's really coming down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.76,0:11:07.14,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.14,0:11:07.85,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.06,0:11:11.31,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Look at that umbrella go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.31,0:11:12.88,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.88,0:11:14.27,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-uh. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.94,0:11:20.36,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.65,0:11:23.49,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, later, Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.34,0:11:42.01,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Wanna walk home together?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.34,0:11:42.01,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Let's walk home together!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.84,0:11:45.68,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.72,0:11:52.02,Default,Instructor 2,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, but you haven't been given permission so...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.02,0:11:56.44,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I know. But the wind is only gonna get stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.44,0:11:59.78,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,so let me try calling Ms. Nitani to see it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.78,0:12:03.36,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll have her talk to you too, to confirm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.49,0:12:06.83,Default,Instructor 2,0000,0000,0000,,Um... In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.83,0:12:09.24,Default,Instructor 1,0000,0000,0000,,We can go home early, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.24,0:12:10.33,Default,Instructor 2,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.37,0:12:13.79,Default,Instructors 1 and 2,0000,0000,0000,,Well, we were just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.52,0:12:36.65,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.65,0:12:37.44,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.31,0:12:39.27,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.24,0:12:49.62,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.62,0:12:51.33,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Get behind me and follow along!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.88,0:13:00.30,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.17,0:13:03.30,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll bring you a towel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.84,0:13:05.88,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,The storm windows!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.44,0:13:21.90,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Cool! Lemme get this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.28,0:13:26.86,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Careful. Don't crush your fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.83,0:13:35.29,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It's dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.92,0:13:49.22,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Y'know, it's kind of like a secret base!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.06,0:13:54.77,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It's in my eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.77,0:13:56.73,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna rinse it now, so don't open your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.73,0:14:04.36,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,All right, dry the rest yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.61,0:14:11.74,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, your back is huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.58,0:14:16.83,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I know, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.83,0:14:21.50,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening! It's Nitani!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.46,0:14:25.13,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,All right! Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.93,0:14:30.89,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,So you {\i1}were{\i0} able to get off work early...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.51,0:14:33.93,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I hope I didn't go too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.93,0:14:37.39,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all! It was a big help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.39,0:14:40.60,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry. Kouki got soaked on the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.60,0:14:44.77,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Really, I don't know where to begin to apologize...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.38,0:14:55.03,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That looks good on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.45,0:15:00.08,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, let me borrow yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.08,0:15:02.46,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Again?! You mean "Mr. Daikichi", right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.46,0:15:04.67,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,He said "Daikichi" is fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.67,0:15:08.09,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I'm more comfortable with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.09,0:15:08.88,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.88,0:15:11.22,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Just "Daikichi" is fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.23,0:15:21.98,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, you're good at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.98,0:15:23.69,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I can use a knife, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.81,0:15:26.57,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You're already a young lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.57,0:15:28.44,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi does the fire, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.44,0:15:29.99,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do it too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.86,0:15:34.66,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,But you never help out...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.66,0:15:36.30,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'll cut too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.30,0:15:38.79,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll lend you my knife!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.96,0:15:46.17,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no! Onions suck!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.17,0:15:49.51,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Don't touch it! Go wash your eyes out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.80,0:15:52.30,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.22,0:15:53.34,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Oh, no! I'm crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.88,0:16:01.93,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Y'know, we're making hamburger patties...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.93,0:16:06.06,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yep... It looks delicious, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.69,0:16:09.11,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,These are kind of strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.53,0:16:11.99,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,They're not strange! Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.32,0:16:15.53,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I'm sure they'll taste fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.53,0:16:19.04,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! The eggs are boiled!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.04,0:16:20.58,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Can you peel them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.20,0:16:22.75,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.75,0:16:29.59,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Done!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.59,0:16:30.76,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.38,0:16:34.01,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's eating it up...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.76,0:16:40.26,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, do you love your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.85,0:16:47.11,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Sure. If only she didn't bug me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.53,0:16:56.24,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,There's a sense of security here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.95,0:17:01.62,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,This one's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.62,0:17:03.75,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Where are your manners?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.83,0:17:09.04,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.04,0:17:11.25,Default,All,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.64,0:17:26.69,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, use your chopsticks!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.69,0:17:28.56,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I know, I'm just getting it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.37,0:17:42.70,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's good, isn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.70,0:17:44.33,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It {\i1}is{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.33,0:17:46.54,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Food tastes better when we eat it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.08,0:17:49.67,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Let's eat here again tomorrow night!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.67,0:17:50.96,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.18,0:18:02.89,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.89,0:18:04.43,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll finish up later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.93,0:18:05.85,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.19,0:18:13.40,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,And then it hit him right in the head!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.49,0:18:17.40,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,He's so excited...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.40,0:18:21.12,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,He's never had this kind of fun before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.12,0:18:23.99,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so happy for this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.99,0:18:25.70,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.70,0:18:28.33,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I didn't... I should thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.29,0:18:32.46,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Teacher said we didn't need those circles!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.46,0:18:34.75,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Leaving work early was worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.75,0:18:37.59,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Just to see that smiling face.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.84,0:18:42.65,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She's raising a child alone too...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.65,0:18:46.31,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Come here a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.31,0:18:47.73,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,All right...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.32,0:18:57.03,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I think it's about time...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.03,0:18:58.69,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Should I call a taxi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.69,0:19:01.07,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.53,0:19:04.99,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you stay over?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.87,0:19:08.20,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.20,0:19:10.83,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Well, Reina and her mom stayed over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.83,0:19:12.54,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That was different!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.21,0:19:17.76,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,See ya tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.13,0:19:19.55,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.55,0:19:20.51,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.51,0:19:23.28,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.28,0:19:25.47,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.81,0:19:28.13,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,We had fun, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.13,0:19:28.89,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.77,0:19:30.85,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.40,0:20:18.44,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.22,0:22:10.43,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The typhoon left, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.43,0:22:11.85,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.85,0:22:15.89,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! Hey, Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.89,0:22:17.77,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki's here already!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.77,0:22:19.98,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,He's early again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.06,0:22:22.87,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Come on in!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.87,0:22:24.78,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,You sure...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.40,0:22:27.95,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.40,0:22:27.95,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.74,0:22:36.12,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to open the storm windows...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.88,0:22:44.75,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Not a cloud in the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.25,0:22:47.09,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.76,0:22:49.55,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, we're gonna be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.51,0:22:51.84,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,See ya later!
